> Module DistressedAssetTaxModel

```catala
declaration enumeration TaxResidence:
  -- US
  -- Foreign

declaration structure Individual:
  data tax_residence content TaxResidence

declaration structure Asset:
  data basis content money
  data fair_market_value content money
  data sale_price content money

declaration structure TrustArrangement:
  data taxpayer content Individual
  data transferor content Individual
  data asset content Asset
  data taxpayer_has_section_678_power content boolean
  data taxpayer_bore_economic_loss content boolean

declaration scope DistressedAssetTrustComputation:
  input arrangement content TrustArrangement
  input tax_rate content decimal

  internal realized_loss content money
  internal claimed_loss content money

  output would_be_tax_savings content money
```
```catala
scope DistressedAssetTrustComputation:
  definition realized_loss equals
    arrangement.asset.basis - arrangement.asset.sale_price

  definition claimed_loss equals
    if arrangement.taxpayer_has_section_678_power then
      realized_loss
    else
      $0

  definition would_be_tax_savings equals
    claimed_loss * tax_rate
```